WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:06.172
- HEY, HEY, HEY, ALL RIGHT.
- HEY.

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:07.640
- HI, SWEETIE,
THAT'S FOR YOU.

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:08.942
- HEY, TRACE.
HOW YOU DOING, GIRL?

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:10.610
- CHECK IT OUT.
- OH, MY.

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:12.112
- GIRL, I GOT A SUNKEN TUB.
YOU GOT TO SEE IT.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:13.613
- OH, I GOT TO SEE THIS.
- ALL RIGHT.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.115
- YOU TWO
HAVE A GOOD TIME NOW.

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:16.783
- HAVE FUN, HAVE FUN.
[door closes]

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.251
DUDE, I AM SORRY
WE'RE LATE, MAN.

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:20.053
- MAN, IT HAPPENS, MAN.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.454
- AND SHE TALK ABOUT HOW
WE'RE SUPPOSED TO BE IN THE CAR 

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:22.689
AT 6:45,
I'M LIKE, "ALL RIGHT."

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.391
- UH-OH.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:25.725
- TELL ME MY DUMB ASS
AIN'T SITTING IN THE CAR,

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:27.694
WAITING UNTIL 7:15.

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:29.396
- NUH-UH.

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:31.064
- OKAY, WHEN I TRACK MY WIFE
DOWN 20 MINUTES LATER,

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:33.099
SHE'S STEPPING OUT
THE DAMN SHOWER TALKING ABOUT,

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:34.734
"CAN I HELP YOU?"

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:36.336
- SEE, THAT'S CRAZY
RIGHT THERE.

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:39.773
- I LOOKED THIS WOMAN
IN THE EYE, I SAID,

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:43.610
"BITCH, YOU TOLD ME 6:45."

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:44.778
- YOU SAID THAT?

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:47.013
- PSH, YEAH I SAID--

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.649
"BITCH."
THEN I LAID IT OUT.

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:51.017
- BUT YOU SAID, "BITCH,"
THOUGH?

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:52.052
- HMM?

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:53.553
- YOU SAID, "BITCH"?

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.022
- YEAH.

00:00:56.189 --> 00:00:58.091
- YOU GOT TO SEE THE FIREPLACE
DOWNSTAIRS IN THE LIVING ROOM.

00:00:58.258 --> 00:00:59.893
- OKAY.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.494
- DON'T PLAY GAMES, MAN.

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:03.063
JUST TELL ME WHAT YOU'RE
GOING TO TELL ME.

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:04.564
- EXACTLY, IT'S LIKE,
SAY WHAT YOU MEAN,

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:05.732
MEAN WHAT YOU SAY.
- IS THAT SO HARD?

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:07.067
- IT'S LIKE LAST WEEK, MAN.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:08.568
WE GOING OUT TO DINNER,
RIGHT?

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.036
I'M LIKE,
"WHERE DO YOU WANT TO GO?"

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:11.638
SHE'S LIKE, "YOU DECIDE."
- UH-OH.

00:01:11.805 --> 00:01:12.972
- I'M LIKE, "ALL RIGHT,
OUTBACK STEAKHOUSE."

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:14.441
SHE LIKE, "NAH."
- MM-HMM.

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:15.809
- I'M LIKE,
"STRAIGHT UP, CHILI'S."

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:17.377
SHE'S LIKE, "EHH."
- NO, NO.

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.379
- DARRELL, I NAMED
SEVEN MORE RESTAURANTS.

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:21.047
- NO, CRAIG, NO.

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:22.515
- I FINALLY SAID,
"TAYLOR'S," THE PLACE I KNOW

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:23.450
SHE WANTS TO GO
IN THE FIRST PLACE.

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:24.617
- RIGHT, RIGHT.

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:26.052
- SHE LOOK AT ME, SHE SAID,

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:27.353
"IF THAT'S WHERE
YOU WANT TO GO."

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.788
- NO, SHE DIDN'T, CRAIG.

00:01:28.955 --> 00:01:30.457
- IF THAT'S WHERE
I WANT TO GO.

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:32.258
DARRELL, I LOOKED MY WOMAN
IN THE EYE SOCKETS.

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:35.962
I TOLD HER STRAIGHT OUT,
I JUST SAID IT, MAN, I SAID IT.

00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:42.068
I SAID, I SAID, I SAID--

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:43.970
I SAID, "BI..."
- HEY, GUYS.

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:45.105
- HEY GIRL, HOW YOU DOING?
- OH, HOW YOU DOING?

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.840
- YOU HAVING A GOOD TIME?

00:01:47.006 --> 00:01:48.675
- YOU SEEN THE BEDROOM?
- JUST LOOKING AT THE WOOD.

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:50.510
- THAT WASHING MACHINE IS HUGE.
- UP ON THE CEILING HERE.

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:52.312
- YOU GET A WHOLE BUNCH OF
CLOTHES IN THAT WASHING MACHINE.

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:53.546
- HEY, BABY, I'M GOING TO TAKE
HER BACK UP TO THE KITCHEN

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:55.482
AND SHOW HER THE DISHWASHER.

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:57.383
- DARRELL?
- YEAH, BABY?

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.252
- I WANT A KITCHEN ISLAND
JUST LIKE THE ONE UPSTAIRS.

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:00.987
- YOU GONNA GET IT TOO.

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:02.155
- I LOVE YOU.

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:04.591 line:92%
- I LOVE YOU.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:09.529
- I SAID, "BITCH,
IF YOU WANTED TO GO TO TAYLOR'S,

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:11.798
JUST TELL A BROTHER
YOU WANT TO GO TO TAYLOR'S!"

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:13.433
OKAY?
- YOU SAID THAT?

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:15.301
- OH, HELL YEAH, MAN.
I LAID IT OUT, RIGHT?

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:21.341
I SAYS--I SAYS--I SAYS--

00:02:21.508 --> 00:02:24.978
I SAID, "BITCH,
I'M THE MAN OF THE HOUSE."

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:26.146
- YOU SAID, "BITCH," THOUGH?

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:27.547
- HMM?

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:29.182
- YOU CALLED
YOUR WIFE A BITCH?

00:02:29.349 --> 00:02:30.917
- UH-HUH, YEAH.

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:31.985
- CRAIG.
- DARRELL.

00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:33.553
- WHERE ARE THOSE GUYS?

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:38.091
- I DON'T KNOW.
LET'S GO...

00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:39.692
- SO SHE'S LIKE,
"WHY DON'T YOU RENT A MOVIE

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:41.494
WE BOTH LIKE?"
- NO, SHE DIDN'T.

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:43.596
- AFTER I SPENT 25 MINUTES
IN THE GODDAMN BLOCKBUSTER.

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:47.400
CRAIG, I LOOKED THIS WOMAN
IN HER OPTIC STEMS AND I SAYS--

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:49.302
I SAID--

00:02:51.905 --> 00:02:53.907
I SAYS, "BITCH."

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:55.241
- YOU SAID THAT?

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:56.643
- AIN'T NOTHING
BUT A THING.

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:59.145
- BUT YOU SAID, "BITCH,"
THOUGH?

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:00.914
- YEP.
- SEE...

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:04.784
[phone rings]

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:06.853
- OH, SH--

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:09.689
HEY, HONEY, CRAIG'S JUST
GIVING ME THE NEIGHBORHOOD TOUR.

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:11.891
- SO THEN SHE'S LIKE,
"I DIDN'T KNOW WE'D BE DOING

00:03:12.058 --> 00:03:13.893
SO MUCH WALKING."
- NUH-UH.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.829
- I'M LIKE, "I DIDN'T TELL YOU
TO WEAR THOSE SHOES."

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:18.965
SHE SAID, "DON'T RAISE
YOUR VOICE AT ME."

00:03:19.132 --> 00:03:20.833
- WHAT?

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:26.873
- DARRELL, I LOOKED THIS WOMAN
DEAD IN THE WINDOWS OF HER SOUL.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.841
- MM-HMM.
- I SAID--

00:03:35.715 --> 00:03:37.850
I SAID...

00:03:44.591 --> 00:03:46.926
[door opens, air hisses]

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:58.371
I SAID, "BITCH."

